1
00:00:00,922 --> 00:00:03,192
(Penny:)Hey, you guys want
to play a drinking game?

2
00:00:03,191 --> 00:00:05,121
Oh, well now, well now,
we'll never win.

3
00:00:05,126 --> 00:00:07,826
(Sheldon:)You always play
the drinking game.

4
00:00:07,829 --> 00:00:11,369
Not the drinking game,
a drinking game.

5
00:00:11,366 --> 00:00:13,736
(Leonard:)To be fair, good at both.

6
00:00:13,735 --> 00:00:15,235
(Amy:)What's the game?

7
00:00:15,236 --> 00:00:16,606
(Penny:)All right, it's called
Never Have I Ever.

8
00:00:16,604 --> 00:00:17,804
(Penny:)The rules are simple.

9
00:00:17,806 --> 00:00:19,136
(Penny:)Someone says something
they've never done,

10
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:21,170
(Penny:)but if you have done it,
you take a drink.

11
00:00:21,176 --> 00:00:22,346
(Leonard:)I've never played that before.

12
00:00:22,343 --> 00:00:23,373
(stammers)
Hey, now, wait.

13
00:00:23,378 --> 00:00:24,378
(Sheldon:)Have we started?
Do I drink?

14
00:00:24,379 --> 00:00:26,909
(Sheldon:)What is happening?
Okay.

15
00:00:26,915 --> 00:00:28,615
(Penny:)Calm down.
I'll go first.

16
00:00:28,616 --> 00:00:30,116
(Penny:)All right, let's see.

17
00:00:30,118 --> 00:00:32,418
(Penny:)Never have I ever...

18
00:00:32,420 --> 00:00:34,790
(Amy:)She's trying
to think of something

19
00:00:34,789 --> 00:00:35,789
(Amy:)she's never done before.

20
00:00:35,790 --> 00:00:37,360
(Amy:)This could take a while.

21
00:00:38,326 --> 00:00:39,556
(Penny:)Very funny.

22
00:00:39,561 --> 00:00:41,591
(Penny:)Okay, never have I ever...

23
00:00:42,564 --> 00:00:43,934
(Penny:)Yeah, you know what?

24
00:00:43,932 --> 00:00:45,132
(Penny:)Let's just circle back.

25
00:00:45,133 --> 00:00:46,863
(Leonard:)Okay, I'll go.

26
00:00:46,868 --> 00:00:49,168
(Leonard:)Never have I ever been arrested.

27
00:00:49,170 --> 00:00:50,600
(Sheldon:)So I drink.

28
00:00:50,605 --> 00:00:52,435
(Amy:)No, it's only
if you've done it.

29
00:00:52,440 --> 00:00:57,020
(Penny:)Got it.

